8. For all 6517B electrometers, press the "LOCAL" and "Z-CHK" keys;
9. Fill in the "Experimental Light Record Form" truthfully, and write the dose card number after the name of the experimenter;
10. Notify the personnel on duty at the experimental station and return the access card and dose card;
